<div class="space-y-6">

  <!-- Channel Testing Framework -->
  <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-gray-200 shadow-lg">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">8 Channels to Test (Pick 3-5)</h3>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">1. Content Marketing (SEO + Blog)</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Write 10 articles targeting high-intent keywords. Track organic traffic and signups.</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1"><strong>Timeline:</strong> 4-8 weeks • <strong>Cost:</strong> Time + $0-50 (tools) • <strong>Best for:</strong> B2B SaaS, info products</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">2. Social Media (Twitter/LinkedIn/Reddit)</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Post daily for 2 weeks. Share insights, not pitches. Drive to landing page.</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1"><strong>Timeline:</strong> 2-4 weeks • <strong>Cost:</strong> Time • <strong>Best for:</strong> Dev tools, B2B, productivity</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">3. Product Hunt / Hacker News Launch</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">One-time spike. Prep for launch day. Reply to all comments. Capture emails.</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1"><strong>Timeline:</strong> 1 day + prep • <strong>Cost:</strong> Time • <strong>Best for:</strong> Tech products, tools, apps</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">4. Cold Outreach (Email/LinkedIn)</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Send 50-100 personalized messages per day. Track open, response, and conversion rates.</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1"><strong>Timeline:</strong> 1-2 weeks • <strong>Cost:</strong> Time + $50 (tools) • <strong>Best for:</strong> B2B, high-ticket services</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">5. Paid Ads (Google/Meta)</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Start with $100 budget. Test 3 ad variations. Measure CPA and quality of signups.</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1"><strong>Timeline:</strong> 1 week • <strong>Cost:</strong> $100-500 • <strong>Best for:</strong> Products with clear value prop</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">6. Community Building (Discord/Slack)</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Create a community around your niche. Provide value first, sell second.</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1"><strong>Timeline:</strong> 4+ weeks • <strong>Cost:</strong> Time • <strong>Best for:</strong> Creator tools, platforms, courses</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">7. Partnerships & Integrations</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Partner with complementary products. Cross-promote. Build integrations.</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1"><strong>Timeline:</strong> 2-4 weeks • <strong>Cost:</strong> Time + rev share • <strong>Best for:</strong> B2B SaaS, marketplaces</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">8. Word of Mouth / Referrals</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Build a referral program. "Give $20, Get $20" or free month for referrals.</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1"><strong>Timeline:</strong> Ongoing • <strong>Cost:</strong> Credits/discounts • <strong>Best for:</strong> Products with network effects</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Testing Framework -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-pink-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-purple-200">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">How to Test Each Channel</h3>
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-purple-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold">1</div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Set Budget & Timeline</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Commit 1-2 weeks and $0-200 per channel. Don't quit too early.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-purple-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold">2</div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Track Key Metrics</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Impressions → Clicks → Signups → Activated Users. Calculate CPA.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-purple-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold">3</div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Measure User Quality</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Not just quantity. Do they activate? Retain? Refer others? Pay?</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-purple-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold">4</div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Double Down or Kill</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">If a channel works, 10x it. If it doesn't, kill it and move to the next.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Channel Comparison Table -->
  <div class="overflow-x-auto">
    <table class="w-full bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg">
      <thead class="bg-gray-100">
        <tr>
          <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left text-sm font-bold text-gray-900">Channel</th>
          <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left text-sm font-bold text-gray-900">Time to Results</th>
          <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left text-sm font-bold text-gray-900">Cost</th>
          <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left text-sm font-bold text-gray-900">Scalability</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-200">
        <tr>
          <td class="px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-gray-900">Content/SEO</td>
          <td class="px-4 py-3 text-sm text-gray-600">4-8 weeks</td>
          <td class="px-4 py-3 text-sm text-gray-600">Low</td>
          <td class="px-4 py-3 text-sm text-green-600">High</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-gray-900">Social Media</td>
          <td class="px-4 py-3 text-sm text-gray-600">1-2 weeks</td>
          <td class="px-4 py-3 text-sm text-gray-600">Low</td>
          <td class="px-4 py-3 text-sm text-yellow-600">Medium</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-gray-900">Cold Outreach</td>
          <td class="px-4 py-3 text-sm text-gray-600">1 week</td>
          <td class="px-4 py-3 text-sm text-gray-600">Low</td>
          <td class="px-4 py-3 text-sm text-yellow-600">Medium</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-gray-900">Paid Ads</td>
          <td class="px-4 py-3 text-sm text-gray-600">2-3 days</td>
          <td class="px-4 py-3 text-sm text-gray-600">High</td>
          <td class="px-4 py-3 text-sm text-green-600">High</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-gray-900">Product Hunt</td>
          <td class="px-4 py-3 text-sm text-gray-600">1 day</td>
          <td class="px-4 py-3 text-sm text-gray-600">Low</td>
          <td class="px-4 py-3 text-sm text-red-600">One-time</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

</div>
